# NOTICE

This repository is maintained by **Vansh Bhasin** (`@bhasinvansh05`).

## Product

**Kronos Market Foresight** — a personal web application for live market charts
and short-horizon forecasts. Primary entrypoint: `webapp/`.

## Upstream model

The Kronos foundation-model architecture and pretrained weights originate from
the open-source Kronos project by ShiYu / NeoQuasar (MIT License):

- Upstream repository: https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos
- Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.02739
- Weights on Hugging Face: https://huggingface.co/NeoQuasar

Model checkpoint IDs (e.g. `NeoQuasar/Kronos-mini`) are referenced as published
by the upstream authors. This fork’s application layer, UI, market-data
integration, backtesting tooling, and documentation are original work by
Vansh Bhasin unless otherwise noted.

